=2 Walkthrough
* After clearing all three Promyvions, you will appear at (K-9) in {z:Lufaise Meadows} and immediately enter a cutscene.
* When the cutscene ends, make your way west toward {z:Tavnazian Safehold}. The entrance is at (F-10).
** There are many {m:Orcs|Orc}, {m:Gigas}, and {p:Bugards|Bugard} along the way that will attack you if you are less than level 45 or so.
** You can ride mounts in this area, avoiding monsters entirely.
* After reaching {z:Tavnazian Safehold}, zone in for another cutscene.

\**Note**: The tunnel just East of where you appear in Lufaise houses a {n:Swirling Vortex} which will transport you to {z:Valkurm Dunes}. You may use the vortex to enter/exit {z:Lufaise Meadows} at anytime now.
